      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the path $C$ is the line segment directed along the $x$-axis. Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=5-2=3.\n$$"
